{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "USGS Volcanoes",
  "description": {
    "en": "Alert levels of the US volcanoes (Hawaii, Alaska, Cascades, Yellowstone…) from the USGS",
    "fr": "Niveaux d'alerte des volcans américains (Hawaï, Alaska, Cascades, Yellowstone…) publiés par l'USGS",
    "de": "Warnstufen der US-Vulkane (Hawaii, Alaska, Kaskaden, Yellowstone…) vom USGS",
    "es": "Niveles de alerta de los volcanes de EE. UU. (Hawái, Alaska, Cascadas, Yellowstone…) del USGS"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/guim31/gladys-usgs-volcanoes:1.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.3.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guim31/gladys-usgs-volcanoes/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["environment", "security"],
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "countries": ["US"],
  "location": true,
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Your volcanoes",
        "fr": "Vos volcans",
        "de": "Deine Vulkane",
        "es": "Sus volcanes"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The USGS volcano observatories rate the monitored US volcanoes: alert level on the ground (Normal, Advisory, Watch, Warning) and aviation color code (Green to Red). Follow volcanoes by name, and/or all those around your house.",
        "fr": "Les observatoires volcanologiques de l'USGS classent les volcans américains surveillés : niveau d'alerte au sol (Normal, Vigilance, Veille, Alerte) et code couleur aviation (vert à rouge). Suivez des volcans par leur nom, et/ou tous ceux autour de votre maison.",
        "de": "Die Vulkanobservatorien des USGS bewerten die überwachten US-Vulkane: Warnstufe am Boden (Normal, Hinweis, Beobachtung, Warnung) und Luftfahrt-Farbcode (Grün bis Rot). Verfolge Vulkane nach Namen und/oder alle rund um dein Haus.",
        "es": "Los observatorios volcanológicos del USGS clasifican los volcanes vigilados de EE. UU.: nivel de alerta en tierra (Normal, Aviso, Vigilancia, Alerta) y código de color de aviación (verde a rojo). Siga volcanes por su nombre y/o todos los que rodean su casa."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/guim31/gladys-usgs-volcanoes/blob/main/docs/en.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Setup guide",
            "fr": "Guide de configuration",
            "de": "Einrichtungsanleitung",
            "es": "Guía de configuración"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://volcanoes.usgs.gov/hans-public/",
          "label": {
            "en": "USGS HANS",
            "fr": "USGS HANS",
            "de": "USGS HANS",
            "es": "USGS HANS"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "volcanoes",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Followed volcanoes",
        "fr": "Volcans suivis",
        "de": "Verfolgte Vulkane",
        "es": "Volcanes seguidos"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Names separated by commas (Kilauea, Mount St. Helens…), volcano numbers, or an observatory (avo, calvo, cvo, hvo, nmi, yvo) for all its volcanoes. One device per volcano.",
        "fr": "Noms séparés par des virgules (Kilauea, Mount St. Helens…), numéros de volcan, ou un observatoire (avo, calvo, cvo, hvo, nmi, yvo) pour tous ses volcans. Un appareil par volcan.",
        "de": "Namen durch Kommas getrennt (Kilauea, Mount St. Helens…), Vulkannummern oder ein Observatorium (avo, calvo, cvo, hvo, nmi, yvo) für alle seine Vulkane. Ein Gerät pro Vulkan.",
        "es": "Nombres separados por comas (Kilauea, Mount St. Helens…), números de volcán o un observatorio (avo, calvo, cvo, hvo, nmi, yvo) para todos sus volcanes. Un dispositivo por volcán."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. Kilauea, Mount Rainier",
        "fr": "ex. Kilauea, Mount Rainier",
        "de": "z. B. Kilauea, Mount Rainier",
        "es": "p. ej. Kilauea, Mount Rainier"
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "radius",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Nearby volcanoes: radius",
        "fr": "Volcans proches : rayon",
        "de": "Vulkane in der Nähe: Radius",
        "es": "Volcanes cercanos: radio"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A \"Nearby volcanoes\" device gives the highest alert level of the monitored volcanoes within this distance of your house. Off: no such device.",
        "fr": "Un appareil « Volcans proches » donne le niveau d'alerte le plus haut des volcans surveillés à cette distance de votre maison. Désactivé : pas d'appareil.",
        "de": "Ein Gerät „Vulkane in der Nähe“ zeigt die höchste Warnstufe der überwachten Vulkane in diesem Umkreis um dein Haus. Aus: kein solches Gerät.",
        "es": "Un dispositivo «Volcanes cercanos» da el nivel de alerta más alto de los volcanes vigilados a esta distancia de su casa. Desactivado: sin dispositivo."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "200",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "0",
          "label": {
            "en": "Off",
            "fr": "Désactivé",
            "de": "Aus",
            "es": "Desactivado"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "50",
          "label": {
            "en": "50 km",
            "fr": "50 km",
            "de": "50 km",
            "es": "50 km"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "100",
          "label": {
            "en": "100 km",
            "fr": "100 km",
            "de": "100 km",
            "es": "100 km"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "200",
          "label": {
            "en": "200 km",
            "fr": "200 km",
            "de": "200 km",
            "es": "200 km"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "500",
          "label": {
            "en": "500 km",
            "fr": "500 km",
            "de": "500 km",
            "es": "500 km"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "1000",
          "label": {
            "en": "1,000 km",
            "fr": "1 000 km",
            "de": "1.000 km",
            "es": "1000 km"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "latitude",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Centre latitude",
        "fr": "Latitude du centre",
        "de": "Breitengrad des Mittelpunkts",
        "es": "Latitud del centro"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Leave both coordinates empty to use the location of your house in Gladys.",
        "fr": "Laissez les deux coordonnées vides pour utiliser la position de votre maison dans Gladys.",
        "de": "Lass beide Koordinaten leer, um den Standort deines Hauses in Gladys zu verwenden.",
        "es": "Deje ambas coordenadas vacías para usar la ubicación de su casa en Gladys."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. 46.8523",
        "fr": "ex. 46.8523",
        "de": "z. B. 46.8523",
        "es": "p. ej. 46.8523"
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "longitude",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Centre longitude",
        "fr": "Longitude du centre",
        "de": "Längengrad des Mittelpunkts",
        "es": "Longitud del centro"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Decimal degrees, west negative.",
        "fr": "Degrés décimaux, ouest négatif.",
        "de": "Dezimalgrad, Westen negativ.",
        "es": "Grados decimales, oeste negativo."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. -121.7603",
        "fr": "ex. -121.7603",
        "de": "z. B. -121.7603",
        "es": "p. ej. -121.7603"
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_interval",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh interval",
        "fr": "Intervalle de rafraîchissement",
        "de": "Aktualisierungsintervall",
        "es": "Intervalo de actualización"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The observatories publish a few notices a day at most; a level change always comes with a notice.",
        "fr": "Les observatoires publient quelques bulletins par jour au plus ; un changement de niveau vient toujours avec un bulletin.",
        "de": "Die Observatorien veröffentlichen höchstens einige Meldungen am Tag; eine Stufenänderung kommt immer mit einer Meldung.",
        "es": "Los observatorios publican unos pocos boletines al día como máximo; un cambio de nivel siempre llega con un boletín."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "15",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "10",
          "label": {
            "en": "10 minutes",
            "fr": "10 minutes",
            "de": "10 Minuten",
            "es": "10 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "15",
          "label": {
            "en": "15 minutes",
